{title: Gloria a Dios, gloria al Padre}
{key: C#m}
{meta: category Gloria}

{start_of_verse}
[C#m]Gloria a Dios, Gloria a Dios,
[B]Gloria al [C#m]Padre. (x2)
A Él [B]que sea [G#7]la glori[C#m]a. (x2)
[B]Aleluya amé[C#m]n. (x3)
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[C#m]Gloria a Dios, Gloria a Dios,
[B]Gloria al [C#m]hijo. (x2)
A Él [B]que sea [G#7]la Glori[C#m]a.
[B]Aleluya amé[C#m]n. (x3)
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[C#m]Gloria a Dios, Gloria a Dios,
